" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg></a><a aria-label=\"View shopping cart, 0 items\" class=\"relative inline-flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-full text-teal-700 hover:bg-mint-light transition-colors\" href=\"/cart\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shopping-bag\"><path d=\"M6 2 3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4Z\"></path><path d=\"M3 6h18\"></path><path d=\"M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0\"></path></svg></a><button aria-label=\"Open menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"lg:hidden inline-flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-full text-teal-700 hover:bg-mint-light transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\"><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button></div></div></header><main id=\"main-content\"><div class=\"bg-cream\"><section class=\"relative py-16 sm:py-24 overflow-hidden\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"w-5 h-5 absolute top-10 left-[10%] w-6 h-6 hidden sm:block\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M12 2.5c.4 3.2 1 5.4 2 6.4s3.2 1.6 6.4 2c-3.2.4-5.4 1-6.4 2s-1.6 3.2-2 6.4c-.4-3.2-1-5.4-2-6.4s-3.2-1.6-6.4-2c3.2-.4 5.4-1 6.4-2s1.6-3.2 2-6.4Z\" fill=\"#FFC44D\"></path></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"w-5 h-5 absolute bottom-10 right-[12%] w-5 h-5 hidden sm:block\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M12 20.5s-7.6-4.6-10-9.1C.4 8.3 2 5 5.4 5c1.9 0 3.4 1 4.6 2.6C11.2 6 12.7 5 14.6 5 18 5 19.6 8.3 18 11.4c-2.4 4.5-6 9.1-6 9.1Z\" fill=\"#6DBFD8\"></path></svg><div class=\"container-content grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center\"><div class=\"text-center lg:text-left\"><h1 class=\"font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl text-teal-800\">Our Story</h1><p class=\"mt-5 text-teal-700/70 leading-relaxed max-w-lg mx-auto lg:mx-0\">TinyTods began with a simple wish: to make it easy for parents to find products that feel as caring as they look. What started as a small collection of favorites has grown into a home for everything a little one needs — chosen thoughtfully, wrapped with love, and delivered with a smile.</p><div class=\"mt-8\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full font-semibold transition-all duration-300 ease-out hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:translate-y-0 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:translate-y-0 bg-teal-700 text-cream hover:bg-teal-800 shadow-soft px-6 py-3 text-sm\" href=\"/categories\">Shop Our Collection</a></div></div><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/5] max-w-sm mx-auto rounded-blob overflow-hidden shadow-lift bg-mint-light\"><img alt=\"TinyTods curated baby products\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 80vw, 40vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.unsplash.com%2Fphoto-1608889825205-eebdb9fc5806%3Fw%3D900%26q%3D80%26auto%3Dformat%26fit%3Dcrop&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.unsplash.com%2Fphoto-1608889825205-eebdb9fc5806%3Fw%3D900%26q%3D80%26auto%3Dformat%26fit%3Dcrop&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.unsplash.com%2Fphoto-1608889825205-eebdb9fc5806%3Fw%3D900%26q%3D80%26auto%3Dformat%26fit%3Dcrop&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.unsplash.com%2Fphoto-1608889825205-eebdb9fc5806%3Fw%3D900%26q%3D80%26auto%3Dformat%26fit%3Dcrop&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.unsplash.com%2Fphoto-1608889825205-eebdb9fc5806%3Fw%3D900%26q%3D80%26auto%3Dformat%26fit%3Dcrop&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.unsplash.com%2Fphoto-1608889825205-eebdb9fc5806%3Fw%3D900%26q%3D80%26auto%3Dformat%26fit%3Dcrop&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.unsplash.com%2Fphoto-1608889825205-eebdb9fc5806%3Fw%3D900%26q%3D80%26auto%3Dformat%26fit%3Dcrop&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.unsplash.com%2Fphoto-1608889825205-eebdb9fc5806%3Fw%3D900%26q%3D80%26auto%3Dformat%26fit%3Dcrop&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.unsplash.com%2Fphoto-1608889825205-eebdb9fc5806%3Fw%3D900%26q%3D80%26auto%3Dformat%26fit%3Dcrop&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.unsplash.com%2Fphoto-1608889825205-eebdb9fc5806%3Fw%3D900%26q%3D80%26auto%3Dformat%26fit%3Dcrop&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.unsplash.com%2Fphoto-1608889825205-eebdb9fc5806%3Fw%3D900%26q%3D80%26auto%3Dformat%26fit%3Dcrop&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div></section><section class=\"py-16 sm:py-20 bg-white\"><div class=\"container-content grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"rounded-4xl bg-cream p-7 sm:p-8\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-mint-light flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles text-teal-700\"><path d=\"M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z\"></path><path d=\"M20 3v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 5h-4\"></path><path d=\"M4 17v2\"></path><path d=\"M5 18H3\"></path></svg></div><h2 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-xl text-teal-800\">Why TinyTods</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-teal-700/70 leading-relaxed\">We started TinyTods because finding truly thoughtful baby products shouldn&#x27;t be a search. Every item in our store passes a simple test: would we choose it for our own family?</p></div><div class=\"rounded-4xl bg-cream p-7 sm:p-8\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-mint-light flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check text-teal-700\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><h2 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-xl text-teal-800\">Quality Promise</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-teal-700/70 leading-relaxed\">From stitching to packaging, we check for safety, durability and comfort before anything reaches our shelves — and yours.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-4xl bg-cream p-7 sm:p-8\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-mint-light flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart text-teal-700\"><path d=\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"></path></svg></div><h2 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-xl text-teal-800\">Our Mission</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-teal-700/70 leading-relaxed\">To make everyday parenting a little softer, a little easier, and a lot more joyful, one small product at a time.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-4xl bg-cream p-7 sm:p-8\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-mint-light flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users text-teal-700\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg></div><h2 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-xl text-teal-800\">Parents &amp; Little Ones</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-teal-700/70 leading-relaxed\">We build TinyTods around real families — real feedback, real routines, and real little ones who test everything first.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"py-16 sm:py-20\"><div class=\"container-content text-center max-w-2xl\"><h2 class=\"font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-teal-800\">A little brand, built on big love</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-teal-700/70\">Thank you for being part of our journey — we&#x27;re so grateful to have you as part of the TinyTods family.</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex justify-center\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full font-semibold transition-all duration-300 ease-out hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:translate-y-0 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:translate-y-0 bg-transparent border-2 border-teal-700 text-teal-700 hover:bg-teal-700 hover:text-cream px-6 py-3 text-sm\" href=\"/contact\">Get in Touch</a></div></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"relative bg-teal-800 text-cream pt-16 pb-8 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"container-content grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-